==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From ''[[ná]]'' meaning "to [[get]]" and ''[[sér#Icelandic|sér]]'' the dative of ''[[sig#Icelandic|sig]]'' meaning "[[oneself]]".

===Verb===
{{head|is|verb|head=[[ná#Icelandic|ná]] [[sig#Icelandic|sér]]}}

# to [[pull through]]
# to [[recover]], to become ''well'' again
#: {{ux|is|Efnahagurinn mun ekki '''ná sér'''.|The economy will not '''recover'''.}}
# {{lb|is|chiefly|used of a person}} to [[pull oneself together]], to recover [[health]] or strength, to [[rally]], [[recuperate]]

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|to pull through}} {{l|is|komast yfir}}
* {{sense|pull oneself together}} {{l|is|jafna sig}}

